cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "COMPASS-OS"
abstract: >-
  COMPASS-OS is a frozen-asset inference package for pan-cancer overall-survival
  risk prediction from bulk transcriptomic expression. From one expression
  matrix it returns a relative prognostic risk score with cohort
  stratification, a 43-concept COMPASS representation, a 132-gene-signature
  representation, and gene/signature/concept coverage QC. It provides a
  one-click analysis entry point and a controlled advanced API; no model
  training, re-fitting or tuning happens at prediction time.
type: software
version: 1.0.1
date-released: "2026-10-03"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/RENSI203/COMPASS-OS"
authors:
