    title: "Generalizable AI predicts immunotherapy outcomes across cancers and treatments"
    journal: "Nature Medicine"
    year: 2026
    notes: >-
      Upstream COMPASS model. COMPASS-OS incorporates vendored components from
      COMPASS under its upstream MIT license; see third_party/COMPASS_LICENSE.
